# Example 2 — CloudFront with an Application Load Balancer

CloudFront can also be placed in front of an ALB.

```text
User
 ↓
CloudFront
 ↓
ALB
 ↓
Target Group
 ↓
EC2
```

For example, suppose my application is running on multiple EC2 instances:

```text
                 CloudFront
                     ↓
                    ALB
                     ↓
             ┌───────┼───────┐
             ↓       ↓       ↓
           EC2-1   EC2-2   EC2-3
```

CloudFront can handle global content delivery while the ALB distributes application traffic across healthy backend instances.

