# CloudFront with Route 53

Route 53 can be used for DNS while CloudFront handles content delivery.

Example:

```text
User
 ↓
example.com
 ↓
Route 53
 ↓
CloudFront
 ↓
Origin
```

This is a common AWS architecture for websites.

