# CloudFront in a DevOps Architecture

A production-style architecture can look like:

```text
                         Users
                           │
                           ▼
                       Route 53
                           │
                           ▼
                       CloudFront
                           │
                     ┌─────┴─────┐
                     │           │
                   Static      Dynamic
                  Content       APIs
                     │           │
                     ▼           ▼
                    S3          ALB
                                 │
                         ┌───────┼───────┐
                         ▼       ▼       ▼
                        EC2    EC2     EC2
```

This architecture separates:

- Static content → S3
- Global delivery → CloudFront
- Application traffic → ALB
- Backend workloads → EC2

