style.css
script.js
profile.jpg
```

I upload everything to S3:

```text
S3 Bucket
   │
   ├── index.html
   ├── style.css
   ├── script.js
   └── profile.jpg
```

Then I create a CloudFront distribution:

```text
User
 ↓
CloudFront
 ↓
S3
```

